{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46092","headline":"经弟妹坟 · 贯休","name":"经弟妹坟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"泪不曾垂此日垂，山前弟妹塚离离。\n年长於吾未得力，家贫抛尔去多时。\n鸿冲□□霜中断，蕙杂黄蒿冢上衰。\n恩爱苦情抛未得，不堪回首步迟迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}